          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our mission",
            "text": "<p>At Monthlies, we aim to help all women have a pain-free period, while providing the best possible care for their overall well-being. Above all, this means getting \"WOW\" results.<br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "template--19546143687003__dd31ecd9-c868-4a77-9192-ddb048454840-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Our expertise",
            "text": "<p>Our team of female experts and in-house naturopathic doctors, is dedicated to putting science first in everything we do. We pride ourselves on product curation and development focused on research.</p><p>We deliver natural premium formulas that target menstrual care and holistic health. </p>"
          }
        },
        "4746938f-f34e-4654-8d0f-b39f891f079f": {
