          "settings": {
            "title": "Our delivery policy",
            "text": "<p>We currently offer shipping throughout Germany and UK. </p><p>We strive to ship and deliver your order as quickly and efficiently as possible.</p><p>Your order will be processed within 1-2 business days at which time you will receive a confirmation email with a tracking number. From there, our standard shipping times range from 3-5 business days.</p><p><em>If you have any questions, please write to us at info@withmonthlies.com</em></p>"
          }
        }
